  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Stages one exact-edition physical tabletop intake packet for **Dominion**.\n- Scope: current Rio Grande Games English 2nd Edition base game, stock RIO531; expansions, promos, online play, digital adaptations, and complete card-text history excluded.\n- Cohort: `rotating_focus`; focus fit: classic market-centric competitive deck-builder.\n- No canonical `KnowledgeBase/BoardGames/games/dominion/` tree, `approval.json`, or promotion was authored.\n\n## Audit status\n\n`ready_for_audit` is the Bathcat pre-approval state. This head is **not approved, promoted, or merge-ready by Bathcat**. A fresh Mennonite context must independently reopen the sources, verify claims and visuals, bind approval to the frozen packet hash, and perform any later promotion on this same PR branch.\n\n- Base SHA: `e6b066ad61e135f211cb51a9108ad025ca9b6e5a`\n- Bathcat head SHA: `85437449cad317ce86bd452d5cc2ce4b8e63f795`\n- Run: `2026-08-08-dominion`\n- Candidate slug: `dominion`\n- Packet hash: `7210fa7b5fde05633ee0f91060e43f83782051d7572a42fa391d52309a158ca2`\n\n## Governing sources\n\n- Official product page: https://www.riograndegames.com/games/dominion/\n- Official current core rulebook: https://www.riograndegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Dominion2E.pdf\n  - HTTP 200, `application/pdf`, 4,965,016 bytes, 16 pages\n  - SHA-256: `ea9e3fbef0064e6773c8772bbb234ac7d06c71a478422b45143432a29aa64273`\n- Independent review: https://www.boardgamequest.com/dominion-review/\n  - HTTP 200, dated February 26, 2013\n- Three reduced, source-linked visual references from the independent review are in the packet with source hashes and conservative editorial-excerpt rights notes.\n- Community errata boundary (not used as official current-print law): https://dominionstrategy.com/2019/09/25/dominion-2019-errata-and-rules-tweaks/\n\n## Verification run\n\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --run 2026-08-08-dominion` \u2014 clean\n- prescribed intake/provenance suite \u2014 47 tests, 46 pass, 1 intentional skip, 0 fail\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main` \u2014 clean\n- `node scripts/generate-index.mjs` \u2014 completed; no corpus index delta\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs` \u2014 2,670 files clean + INDEX fresh\n- `node --test scripts/validate-okf-visuals.test.mjs` \u2014 5 pass, 0 fail\n- `git diff --check` \u2014 clean before commit\n- push hook \u2014 intake/provenance checks clean\n\n## Known limits\n\n- `game.weight` is `null`; no BGG rating or complexity claim is made.\n- The packet publishes no complete card-text, expansion, promo, FAQ, or errata denominator. The official core rulebook is the bounded governing authority for the claims actually published.\n- The community errata article is retained only as a provenance boundary and is not silently promoted to publisher authority.\n\nReceiver: fresh Mennonite intake audit context. Bathcat stops at this pre-approval head and will not approve, promote, or merge it.",
